{"5040510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "In Silent Walls : Inside The House", "steam_appid": 5040510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040510/extras/ce097d41713593ba0deeeb30fef5a76b.poster.avif?t=1786652989\" width=1170 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040510/extras/ce097d41713593ba0deeeb30fef5a76b.webm?t=1786652989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040510/extras/ce097d41713593ba0deeeb30fef5a76b.mp4?t=1786652989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>In Silent Walls: Inside the House</strong>, you awaken inside an old, isolated house with no memory of how you got there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore its abandoned rooms, basement, attic, and surrounding buildings. Search your environment, find the items needed to progress, and uncover drawings, handwritten notes, and disturbing memories connected to the <strong>Red Hollow Sanatorium</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something is lurking in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no weapons to defend yourself, you will sometimes have no choice but to hide, run, and survive against a creature that seems to anticipate your every move. As buried memories begin to resurface, the line between reality and hallucination slowly starts to fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040510/extras/6b7df67ffc109e16462e8b9d9bbd2efa.poster.avif?t=1786652989\" width=1170 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040510/extras/6b7df67ffc109e16462e8b9d9bbd2efa.webm?t=1786652989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040510/extras/6b7df67ffc109e16462e8b9d9bbd2efa.mp4?t=1786652989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person psychological horror experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an abandoned house and its surroundings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles and items used to unlock new paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Documents and clues that gradually reveal the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing apparitions, hallucinations, and chase sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat: observe, hide, and run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new story connected to the <strong>Red Hollow Sanatorium</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It’s all in your head… isn’t it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040510/extras/48e2ab52245b3dfb9f2ebeec0c291880.poster.avif?t=1786652989\" width=1170 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040510/extras/48e2ab52245b3dfb9f2ebeec0c291880.webm?t=1786652989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040510/extras/48e2ab52245b3dfb9f2ebeec0c291880.mp4?t=1786652989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.st